#: COM073
msgctxt "COM073"
msgid "The urn is not much use."
msgstr "Urnan är inte till någon större nytta."

#: COM074
msgctxt "COM074"
msgid "A terracotta soldier."
msgstr "En terrakottasoldat."

#: COM075
msgctxt "COM075"
msgid ""
"The temple of the hidden way was crafted with stone and a hunger for "
"knowledge."
msgstr "Den dolda vägens tempel byggdes av sten och en hunger efter kunskap."

#: COM076
msgctxt "COM076"
msgid "A prayer wheel."
msgstr "En bönekvarn."

#: COM077
msgctxt "COM077"
msgid "The wheel is fixed in place."
msgstr "Kvarnen sitter fast."

#: COM078
msgctxt "COM078"
msgid "I can't budget."
msgstr "Jag kan inte rubba den."

#: COM079
msgctxt "COM079"
msgid "Guess this isn't one of the five I need to move."
msgstr "Det här är nog inte en av de fem som jag behöver flytta."

#: COM080
msgctxt "COM080"
msgid "There's already a prayer wheel in place."
msgstr "Det finns redan en bönekvarn på plats."

#: COM081
msgctxt "COM081"
msgid "I'm looking for the path to enlightenment. Can you help me?"
msgstr "Jag söker vägen till upplysning. Kan ni hjälpa mig?"

#: COM083
msgctxt "COM083"
msgid "Maybe when I have something to celebrate, I can pass out cigars."
msgstr "Kanske kan jag dela ut cigarrer när jag har något att fira."

#: COM084
msgctxt "COM084"
msgid "Thanks!"
msgstr "Tack!"

#: COM085
msgctxt "COM085"
msgid "I have that. I don't need a sketch of it."
msgstr "Jag har den där. Jag behöver ingen skiss av den."

#: COM086
msgctxt "COM086"
msgid "I already have it."
msgstr "Jag har redan den."

#: COM087
msgctxt "COM087"
msgid "The vines withered to dried out husks. Now they're useless."
msgstr "Rankorna vissnade till torra skal. Nu är de värdelösa."

#: COM088
msgctxt "COM088"
msgid "With what?"
msgstr "Med vad?"

#: COM089
msgctxt "COM089"
msgid "I don't know."
msgstr "Jag vet inte."

#: COM090A
msgctxt "COM090A"
msgid "I'd better think about that."
msgstr "Jag bör nog tänka på det."

#: COM091
msgctxt "COM091"
msgid "Danzig."
msgstr "Danzig."

#: COM092
msgctxt "COM092"
msgid "PAY PING!"
msgstr "PEIPING!"

#: COM093
msgctxt "COM093"
msgid "SIKIM"
msgstr "SIKKIM"

#: COM094
msgctxt "COM094"
msgid "Peru."
msgstr "Peru."

#: COM095
msgctxt "COM095"
msgid "New York."
msgstr "New York."

#: COM096
msgctxt "COM096"
msgid "I worked hard to rig that. I'll leave it where it is for now."
msgstr ""
"Jag arbetade hårt för att rigga det där. Jag lämnar det där det är tills "
"vidare."

#: COM097
msgctxt "COM097"
msgid "A shiny gold cigar band."
msgstr "Ett glänsande guldcigarrband."

#: COM098
msgctxt "COM098"
msgid "A fine Cubano cigar with a gold band."
msgstr "En fin Cubano-cigarr med guldband."

#: COM099
msgctxt "COM099"
msgid "A fine Cubano cigar."
msgstr "En fin Cubano-cigarr."

#: COM100
msgctxt "COM100"
msgid "I don't smoke."
msgstr "Jag röker inte."

#: COM101
msgctxt "COM101"
msgid "A terracotta horse."
msgstr "En terrakottahäst."

#: COM102
msgctxt "COM102"
msgid "On what?"
msgstr "På vad?"

#: COM103
msgctxt "COM103"
msgid "It would make more noise if I hit it with something."
msgstr "Det skulle låta mer om jag slog på det med något."

#: COM104
msgctxt "COM104"
msgid "It's far too heavy."
msgstr "Den är alldeles för tung."

#: COM105
msgctxt "COM105"
msgid "I need something to secure it with."
msgstr "Jag behöver något att fästa den med."

#: COM106
msgctxt "COM106"
msgid "A shovel."
msgstr "En spade."

#: COM107
msgctxt "COM107"
msgid "A ladder."
msgstr "En stege."

#: COM108
msgctxt "COM108"
msgid "A brown vine."
msgstr "En brun ranka."

#: COM109
msgctxt "COM109"
msgid "A green vine."
msgstr "En grön ranka."

#: COM110
msgctxt "COM110"
msgid "A length of sturdy rope."
msgstr "En längd stadigt rep."

#: COM111
msgctxt "COM111"
msgid "Two vines knotted together."
msgstr "Två rankor som knutits ihop."

#: COM112
msgctxt "COM112"
msgid "A coil of rope."
msgstr "En hoprullad repända."

#: COM112A
msgctxt "COM112A"
msgid "The rope is too short."
msgstr "Repet är för kort."

#: COM113
msgctxt "COM113"
msgid "The vine is too short."
msgstr "Rankan är för kort."

#: COM114
msgctxt "COM114"
msgid "Even tied together, the vines are not quite long enough."
msgstr "Inte ens ihopknutna är rankorna riktigt tillräckligt långa."

#: COM115
msgctxt "COM115"
msgid "Uh-oh, there doesn't seem to be a way to turn it off."
msgstr "Oj då, det verkar inte finnas något sätt att stänga av den."

#: COM116
msgctxt "COM116"
msgid "The horn is filled to the brim with water."
msgstr "Hornet är fyllt till brädden med vatten."

#: COM117
msgctxt "COM117"
msgid "The pull cord has securely plugged one end of the horn."
msgstr "Draglinan har täppt till ena änden av hornet ordentligt."

#: COM118
msgctxt "COM118"
msgid "I don't see any reason to do that right now."
msgstr "Jag ser ingen anledning att göra det just nu."

#: COM119
msgctxt "COM119"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr "Hmm …"

#: COM120
msgctxt "COM120"
msgid "A wooden beam."
msgstr "En träbjälke."

#: COM121
msgctxt "COM121"
msgid "A wooden post."
msgstr "En trästolpe."

#: COM122
msgctxt "COM122"
msgid "May has little use for the crank right now."
msgstr "May har liten användning för vevhandtaget just nu."
